}/* End custom CSS */</style>{"id":267,"slug":"frequently-asked-questions","content":{"raw":"<img width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/FAQs-Page-Banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/FAQs-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/FAQs-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/FAQs-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/FAQs-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/FAQs-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    <h2>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS<\/h2>\n<style>\n.custom-title{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:20px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:300;\n    color:#222222;\n    line-height:1;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:80px;\n    height:0.5px;\n    background:#6d6e71;\n    display:block;\n}\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\n@media(max-width:767px){\n.custom-title{\n    gap:10px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    font-size:14px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:40px;\n    height:0.25px;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1710\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1710\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Does FIERRO offer international shipping? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes! We offer international shipping to most countries! We understand that shipping fees and delivery times can differ based on the destination, so feel free to message us on WhatsApp to get all the details you need. We're here to make sure your order gets to you smoothly and timely, no matter where you are located.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1711\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1711\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Are FIERRO jewelry pieces gentle on sensitive skin? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>We take pride in crafting our jewelry with skin-friendly materials. However, if you have known high allergies or sensitivities, we recommend reaching out to our friendly customer service team for any information you may need. We are here to ensure your jewelry experience is as smooth and pleasant as possible.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1712\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1712\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t How can I best take care of my jewelry? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Taking good care of your FIERRO jewelry is super important to keep it looking fabulous for years to come! For best results, make sure to store your pieces in a cool, dry place, steer clear of harsh chemicals, lotions, etc., and give them a gentle wipe with a soft cloth after each wear. Remember, each piece comes with a care guide to provide you with specific instructions for your new jewelry. Keep sparkling!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1713\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1713\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t How can I contact your customer service? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>You can easily reach our friendly customer service team either by email at support@fierrojewelry.com or through a message on WhatsApp. Our goal is to make your FIERRO experience as dazzling as your favorite jewelry piece.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1714\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1714\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t When will my product get delivered? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Orders will be delivered between 1\u20133 business days in UAE; we will send you a message on WhatsApp or email with the shipping details.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1715\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1715\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t Will my jewelry come with a lovely gift box? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every jewelry piece comes in FIERRO branded gift packaging and a free gift wrap. Want to take it up a notch? For just AED 15, you can opt for a personalized message card to make your gift even more special. It's the little extra touch that makes a big impact. Happy gifting!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1716\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary data-accordion-index=\"7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1716\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t What is the warranty period of FIERRO jewelry? \n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>We provide a one-year international warranty on all FIERRO jewelry starting from the purchase date. This warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship but does NOT cover damage resulting from misuse, accidents, or unauthorized repairs. So go ahead, shine bright!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes! We offer international shipping to most countries! We understand that shipping fees and delivery times can differ based on the destination, so feel free to message us on WhatsApp to get all the details you need. We're here to make sure your order gets to you smoothly and timely, no matter where you are located.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>We take pride in crafting our jewelry with skin-friendly materials. However, if you have known high allergies or sensitivities, we recommend reaching out to our friendly customer service team for any information you may need. We are here to ensure your jewelry experience is as smooth and pleasant as possible.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Taking good care of your FIERRO jewelry is super important to keep it looking fabulous for years to come! For best results, make sure to store your pieces in a cool, dry place, steer clear of harsh chemicals, lotions, etc., and give them a gentle wipe with a soft cloth after each wear. Remember, each piece comes with a care guide to provide you with specific instructions for your new jewelry. Keep sparkling!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>You can easily reach our friendly customer service team either by email at support@fierrojewelry.com or through a message on WhatsApp. Our goal is to make your FIERRO experience as dazzling as your favorite jewelry piece.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Orders will be delivered between 1\u20133 business days in UAE; we will send you a message on WhatsApp or email with the shipping details.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every jewelry piece comes in FIERRO branded gift packaging and a free gift wrap. Want to take it up a notch? For just AED 15, you can opt for a personalized message card to make your gift even more special. It's the little extra touch that makes a big impact. Happy gifting!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<p>We provide a one-year international warranty on all FIERRO jewelry starting from the purchase date. This warranty covers defects in materials and workmanship but does NOT cover damage resulting from misuse, accidents, or unauthorized repairs. So go ahead, shine bright!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n        <h2>LETS SOCIALIZE <\/h2>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/fierrojewellery\/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Instagram-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Instagram\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61592874454475\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Facebook-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Facebook\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@fierrojewellery\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/TikTok-Icon.svg\" alt=\"TitTok\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/971527794759\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Icon.svg\" alt=\"WhatsApp\"><\/a>\n<style>\n    .social-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n.social-icons a img {\n    width: 35px;\n    height: 35px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n.social-icons a img:hover{\n    scale: .9;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 25px!important;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 75px!important;\n    height: 1px;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px!important;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #222222;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-subtitle{\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #6d6e71;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    display: block;\n